{"strongs": "H6186", "word": "עָרַךְ", "translit": "a.rakh", "root": "ערך", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "arrange or set in order", "definition": "עָרַךְ verb arrange or set in order (Late Hebrew id. ; also roll dough, ᵑ7 עֲרַךְ id. ; Phoenician ערכת CIS No. 132, 4 valuation , Bloch , but dubious; Arabic III. contend in battle, , battleground ); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular ׳ ע Job 32:14 ; 2Chr 13:3 , ׳ וְע consecutive Lev 1:12 ; Lev 6:5 עָרַכְתִּי Num 23:4 +, etc.; Imperfect 3 masculine singular יַעֲרֹךְ Exod 27:21 +, etc.; Imperative עֶרְכָה Job 33:5 , עִרְכוּ Jer 46:3 ; Jer 50:14 Infinitive absolute עָרֹךְ Isa 21:5 construct עֲרֹךָ Judg 20:22 +; Participle active plural עֹרְכִים Isa 65:11 , etc.; passive עָרוּךְ Jer 6:23 +, construct עֱרוּךְ Joel 2:5 , etc.; — not in D ; — 1. a. arrange in order , seven altars Num 23:4 , i.e. I have built seven altars in a row (compare בנה v Num 23:1 ), flax-stalks Josh 2:6 (both J E ); especially \\ \\ b. set or lay in order , as wood Gen 22:9 ( E ), 1Kgs 18:33 , compare Tophet Isa 30:33 ; Lev 1:7 offerings Lev 1:8 ; Lev 1:12 ; Lev 6:5 lamp(s) Exod 27:21 ; Lev 24:3 ; Lev 24:4 (all P ), lamp (figurative of dynasty) Ps 132:17 'shew'-bread Exod 40:4 ; Exod 40:23 (upon [ עַל ] sacred שֻׁלְחָן both with accusative of congnate meaning with verb), Lev 24:8 ( P ). \\ \\ c. in common life (compare RS Sem i. 189 f., 2nd ed. 200 f. ), arrange a table (i.e. dishes in order upon it), שֻׁלְחָן Isa 21:5 ; Prov 9:2 (figurative of wisdom), Ezek 23:41 (of Jerusalem in figure); Ps 23:5 ; Ps 78:19 (figurative; subject God); in idolatrous worship Isa 65:11 . \\ \\ d. arrange a battle, i.e. draw up in battle order, מִלְחָמָה Judg 20:22 ; 1Sam 17:8 2 Sam 10:8> = 1Chr 19:9 ; 1Chr 12:37 ( van d. H. v. 1Chr 12:36 ), 2Chr 14:9 , עֹרְכֵי מִלְחָמָה 1Chr 12:34 ; 1Chr 12:36 ( van d. H. v. 1Chr 12:33 v. 1Chr 12:35 ); ׳ עֱרוּךְ מ Joel 2:5 + אֵת with , i.e. against Judg 20:20 ; Gen 14:8 , עִם 2Chr 13:8 + לִקְרַאת 1Sam 17:2 ; 1Chr 19:17 b; מַעֲרָכָה לִקְרַאת ׳ ע 1Sam 17:21 לַמִּלְחָמָה עָרוּךְ כְּאִישׁ Jer 6:23 ; Jer 50:42 object omitted Judg 20:22 ; Judg 20:23 , + לִקְרַאת 1Sam 4:2 ; 2Sam 10:9 ; 2Sam 10:10 = 1Chr 19:10 ; 1Chr 19:11 ; 2Sam 10:17 + אֶל against Judg 20:30 ; Jer 50:14 ; 1Chr 19:17 a, לְ against Jer 50:9 >; — Job 6:4 read יַעַכְרוּנִי Di Bu Du . \\ \\ e. arrange weapons of army in order for battle Jer 46:3 ; 1Chr 12:9 ( van d. H. v. 1Chr 12:8 ). feminine arrange words ( מִלִּין ) Job 32:14 ( + אֶל against ), so (object omitted) Job 33:5 ( + לְפָנַי ), Job 37:19 ; Ps 5:4 (probably; > of arranging a sacrifice); compare recount things in order , יַעְרְכֶהָ לִי Isa 44:7 . \\ \\ g. state in order, set forth a legal case Job 13:18 ; Job 23:4 , so probably (object omitted) of God Ps 50:21 ( + לְעֵינֶיךָ ), and (passive of בְּרִית ) 2Sam 23:5 (compare Dr ). — הֲיַעֲרֹךְ שׁועך Job 36:19 is difficult: Di will he set thy cry ( שַׁוְעֲךָ ) in order? Bi (for לֹא ) לוֺ ׳ הֲיֵעָרֵךְ שׁ shall thy cry be set in order unto him? (sense good, although Niph`al not found ); see al. in Di . 2. a. compare (as result of arranging in order): לֿוֺ ׳ מַהדְּֿמוּת תַּע Isa 40:18 what likeness will ye compare to him? אֵין עֲרֹךְ אֵלֶיךָ Ps 40:6 . \\ \\ b. intransitive be comparable , with לְ , Ps 89:7 (|| דָּמָה ), with suffix of thing compared Job 28:17 ; Job 28:19 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6381')\">BDB6381</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6186')\">H6186</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6380')\">BDB6380</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6382')\">BDB6382</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עָרַךְ</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>arrange or set in order</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; also <highlight>roll</highlight> dough, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>עֲרַךְ</bdbheb> <highlight>id.</highlight>; Phoenician <bdbheb>ערכת</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('CIS')\">CIS<sup> No. 132, 4</sup></lookup> <highlight>valuation</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bloch')\">Bloch</lookup>, but dubious; Arabic <placeholder4074/> III. <highlight>contend</highlight> in battle, <placeholder4075/>, <placeholder4076/> <highlight>battleground</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 32:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,14)\">Job 32:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 13:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,13,3)\">2Chr 13:3</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְע</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Lev 1:12\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(3,1,12)\">Lev 1:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 6:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,5)\">Lev 6:5</ref> <bdbheb>עָרַכְתִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 23:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,4)\">Num 23:4</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יַעֲרֹךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 27:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,21)\">Exod 27:21</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>עֶרְכָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 33:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,5)\">Job 33:5</ref>, <bdbheb>עִרְכוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 46:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,3)\">Jer 46:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,14)\">Jer 50:14</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>עָרֹךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 21:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,21,5)\">Isa 21:5</ref> <highlight>construct</highlight> <bdbheb>עֲרֹךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,22)\">Judg 20:22</ref> +; <highlight>Participle active</highlight> plural <bdbheb>עֹרְכִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 65:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,11)\">Isa 65:11</ref>, etc.; <highlight>passive</highlight> <bdbheb>עָרוּךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 6:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,6,23)\">Jer 6:23</ref> +, construct <bdbheb>עֱרוּךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Joel 2:5\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,5)\">Joel 2:5</ref>, etc.; — not in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlight>arrange in order</highlight>, seven altars <ref ref=\"Num 23:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,4)\">Num 23:4</ref>, i.e. I have built seven altars <highlight>in a row</highlight> (compare <bdbheb>בנה</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Num 23:1\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,1)\">Num 23:1</ref>), flax-stalks <ref ref=\"Josh 2:6\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(6,2,6)\">Josh 2:6</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); especially <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>set</highlight> or <highlight>lay in order</highlight>, as wood <ref ref=\"Gen 22:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,22,9)\">Gen 22:9</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:33\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,33)\">1Kgs 18:33</ref>, compare Tophet <ref ref=\"Isa 30:33\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,33)\">Isa 30:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 1:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,1,7)\">Lev 1:7</ref> offerings <ref ref=\"Lev 1:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,1,8)\">Lev 1:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 1:12\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(3,1,12)\">Lev 1:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 6:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,5)\">Lev 6:5</ref> lamp(s) <ref ref=\"Exod 27:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,21)\">Exod 27:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 24:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,3)\">Lev 24:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 24:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,4)\">Lev 24:4</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), lamp (figurative of dynasty) <ref ref=\"Ps 132:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,17)\">Ps 132:17</ref> 'shew'-bread <ref ref=\"Exod 40:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,4)\">Exod 40:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 40:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,23)\">Exod 40:23</ref> (upon [<bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb>] sacred <bdbheb>שֻׁלְחָן</bdbheb> both with accusative of congnate meaning with verb), <ref ref=\"Lev 24:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,8)\">Lev 24:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> in common life (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RS')\">RS<sup> Sem i. 189 f., 2nd ed. 200 f.</sup></lookup>), <highlight>arrange</highlight> a table (i.e. dishes in order upon it), <bdbheb>שֻׁלְחָן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 21:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,21,5)\">Isa 21:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 9:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,9,2)\">Prov 9:2</ref> (figurative of wisdom), <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:41\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,41)\">Ezek 23:41</ref> (of Jerusalem in figure); <ref ref=\"Ps 23:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,23,5)\">Ps 23:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 78:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,19)\">Ps 78:19</ref> (figurative; subject God); in idolatrous worship <ref ref=\"Isa 65:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,11)\">Isa 65:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <highlight>arrange</highlight> a battle, i.e. draw up in battle order, <bdbheb>מִלְחָמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,22)\">Judg 20:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,8)\">1Sam 17:8</ref> 2 Sam 10:8&gt; = <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,9)\">1Chr 19:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:37\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,37)\">1Chr 12:37</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 12:36\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,36)\">1Chr 12:36</ref>), <ref ref=\"2Chr 14:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,14,9)\">2Chr 14:9</ref>, <bdbheb>עֹרְכֵי מִלְחָמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:34\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,34)\">1Chr 12:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:36\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,36)\">1Chr 12:36</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 12:33\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,33)\">1Chr 12:33</ref> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 12:35\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,35)\">1Chr 12:35</ref>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֱרוּךְ מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Joel 2:5\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,5)\">Joel 2:5</ref> + <bdbheb>אֵת</bdbheb> <highlight>with</highlight>, i.e. <highlight>against</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:20\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,20)\">Judg 20:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 14:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,8)\">Gen 14:8</ref>, <bdbheb>עִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 13:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,13,8)\">2Chr 13:8</ref> + <bdbheb>לִקְרַאת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,2)\">1Sam 17:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,17)\">1Chr 19:17</ref> b; <bdbheb>מַעֲרָכָה לִקְרַאת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:21\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,21)\">1Sam 17:21</ref> <bdbheb>לַמִּלְחָמָה עָרוּךְ כְּאִישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 6:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,6,23)\">Jer 6:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:42\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,42)\">Jer 50:42</ref> object omitted <ref ref=\"Judg 20:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,22)\">Judg 20:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 20:23\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,23)\">Judg 20:23</ref>, + <bdbheb>לִקְרַאת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,2)\">1Sam 4:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:9\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,9)\">2Sam 10:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:10\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,10)\">2Sam 10:10</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:10\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,10)\">1Chr 19:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,11)\">1Chr 19:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:17\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,17)\">2Sam 10:17</ref> + <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> <highlight>against</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:30\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,30)\">Judg 20:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,14)\">Jer 50:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,17)\">1Chr 19:17</ref> a, <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <highlight>against</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 50:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,9)\">Jer 50:9</ref>&gt;; — <ref ref=\"Job 6:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,4)\">Job 6:4</ref> read <bdbheb>יַעַכְרוּנִי</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <highlight>arrange</highlight> weapons of army <highlight>in order</highlight> for battle <ref ref=\"Jer 46:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,3)\">Jer 46:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,9)\">1Chr 12:9</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 12:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,8)\">1Chr 12:8</ref>). <b>feminine</b> <highlight>arrange</highlight> words (<bdbheb>מִלִּין</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Job 32:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,14)\">Job 32:14</ref> ( + <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> <highlight>against</highlight>), so (object omitted) <ref ref=\"Job 33:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,5)\">Job 33:5</ref> ( + <bdbheb>לְפָנַי</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Job 37:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,19)\">Job 37:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 5:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,5,4)\">Ps 5:4</ref> (probably; &gt; of arranging a sacrifice); compare <highlight>recount</highlight> things <highlight>in order</highlight>, <bdbheb>יַעְרְכֶהָ לִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 44:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,7)\">Isa 44:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> <highlight>state in order, set forth</highlight> a legal case <ref ref=\"Job 13:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,18)\">Job 13:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 23:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,23,4)\">Job 23:4</ref>, so probably (object omitted) of God <ref ref=\"Ps 50:21\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,21)\">Ps 50:21</ref> ( + <bdbheb>לְעֵינֶיךָ</bdbheb>), and (passive of <bdbheb>בְּרִית</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"2Sam 23:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,23,5)\">2Sam 23:5</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>). — <bdbheb>הֲיַעֲרֹךְ שׁועך</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 36:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,19)\">Job 36:19</ref> is difficult: <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <highlight>will he set thy cry</highlight> (<bdbheb>שַׁוְעֲךָ</bdbheb>) <highlight>in order?</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bi')\">Bi</lookup> (for <bdbheb>לֹא</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>לוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֲיֵעָרֵךְ שׁ</bdbheb> <highlight>shall thy cry be set in order unto him?</highlight> (sense good, although <b>Niph`al</b> <highlightword>not found</highlightword>); see al. in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. a.</b> <highlight>compare</highlight> (as result of arranging in order): <bdbheb>לֿוֺ</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַהדְּֿמוּת תַּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 40:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,18)\">Isa 40:18</ref> <highlight>what likeness will ye compare to him?</highlight> <bdbheb>אֵין עֲרֹךְ אֵלֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 40:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,6)\">Ps 40:6</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> intransitive <highlight>be comparable</highlight>, with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 89:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,7)\">Ps 89:7</ref> (|| <bdbheb>דָּמָה</bdbheb>), with suffix of thing compared <ref ref=\"Job 28:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,17)\">Job 28:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 28:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,19)\">Job 28:19</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Job 32:14", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 32, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "2Chr 13:3", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 13, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Lev 1:12", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 1, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Lev 6:5", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 6, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Num 23:4", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 23, 